(styles.codes.get(36));\n//=> 39\n```\n\n## 16 / 256 / 16 million (TrueColor) support\n\n`ansi-styles` allows converting between various color formats and ANSI escapes, with support for 16, 256 and [16 million colors","target":"https://gist.github.com/XVilka/8346728","line":123},{"title":"ansi-escapes","target":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/ansi-escapes","line":162},{"title":"Sindre Sorhus","target":"https://github.com/sindresorhus","line":166},{"title":"Josh Junon","target":"https://github.com/qix-","line":167},{"title":"Learn more.","target":"https://tidelift.com/subscription/pkg/npm-ansi-styles?utm_source=npm-ansi-styles&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=enterprise&utm_term=repo","line":173}]}
